{
  "title": "LUXR",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "The LUXR drum",
        "machine (M-VAVE FM-1",
        "firmware) as a sound",
        "generator: eight",
        "drum voices after",
        "the Sonic Potions",
        "LXR, each a synth",
        "layer and a sample",
        "layer, with drive,",
        "delay, reverb, a",
        "master filter, a",
        "compressor and a",
        "limiter.",
        "",
        "Move sequences it:",
        "put LUXR on a drum",
        "track and play the",
        "pads."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "Note map MOVE:",
        "Pads 1-8 (notes",
        "36-43): Kick, Snare,",
        "Clap, Cl Hat,",
        "Op Hat, Tom, Rim,",
        "Cymbal.",
        "Pads 9-16 (44-51):",
        "the same, accented.",
        "Velocity over 110",
        "accents too.",
        "",
        "Note map GM: General",
        "MIDI drum notes.",
        "Note map TONAL:",
        "every note plays",
        "Tonal Snd, C3 its",
        "own pitch.",
        "",
        "The closed hat",
        "chokes the open one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Kits",
          "lines": [
            "The preset browser:",
            "Factory and the 13",
            "LUXR preset patches",
            "(their kits)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sounds",
          "lines": [
            "Each sound: 8 synth",
            "parameters (by its",
            "kind), the sample",
            "layer (sample,",
            "level,",
            "pitch, decay, start,",
            "tone, bend, synth",
            "level), level, pan,",
            "delay, reverb and",
            "drive sends, attack,",
            "gate, release, two",
            "LFOs synced to the",
            "tempo.",
            "Variation rolls the",
            "sound anew (0 = its",
            "factory sound)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Kit",
          "lines": [
            "Volume, Tune, Decay",
            "(all sounds), Output",
            "(+0/+3/+6 dB), Note",
            "Map, Tonal Snd, the",
            "master filter (- low",
            "pass, + high pass)",
            "and its resonance."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "FX",
          "lines": [
            "Drive & Reverb,",
            "Delay (tempo synced:",
            "1/8 to 3/4, mono,",
            "stereo, ping pong),",
            "Compressor, Limiter:",
            "as on LUXR."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
